{"channelId":"UCV841F9OxF_hWZKG9ykbI1g","row":["Taking Care Mobile Massage",56,"Taking Care Mobile Massage proudly provides quality and professional massages to clients right across the great city of Melbourne. Founded by Sandra Allars, who has been a massage therapist since 2000, the service began in the suburb of Berwick but has since expanded to cover all of Melbourne with a team of more than a two dozen dedicated therapists. Taking Care Mobile Massage specialises in the aged care sector by delivering massages to hundreds of clients through their home care packages. Please contact us to find out more on 03 5943 2156 or info@takingcaremobilemassage.com.au","info@takingcaremobilemassage.com.au","Australia"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV841F9OxF_hWZKG9ykbI1g","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV841F9OxF_hWZKG9ykbI1g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:20.268Z","channelId":"UCV841F9OxF_hWZKG9ykbI1g","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"7fbe9bdd4d5bba038504977f690aacca2ca9dda1ce271f46f68d40ad8853855f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"74cd145e41c3cbf269f5e0b00922f0e44b3bac2aaf6ca52b1562de337c3607a3"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV841F9OxF_hWZKG9ykbI1g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:20.268Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV841F9OxF_hWZKG9ykbI1g","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":56,"raw":"56 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV841F9OxF_hWZKG9ykbI1g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:20.268Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"info@takingcaremobilemassage.com.au","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV841F9OxF_hWZKG9ykbI1g"],"evidenceIds":["completion:adc5ec93bdfaec50a06e8491"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:20.268Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"s in the aged c